@baseUrl = http://localhost:5004

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/health

### Create a company
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/companies/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "DEMO",
  "name": "Demo Company"
}

### List companies
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/companies/

### Get a company by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/companies/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Get a company by code
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/companies/by-code/DEMO

### Rename a company
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/companies/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/name
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Renamed Demo Company"
}

### Activate a company
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/companies/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/activate

### Deactivate a company
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/companies/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/deactivate

### Company-scoped endpoint (requires X-Company-Id)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/finance/accounts
X-Company-Id: 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
